; Uninstall confirmation (skipped for silent /S upgrades).
; Version is substituted from Snapmaker_VERSION at CMake configure time.
; Language follows the NSIS installer language ($LANGUAGE).
IfSilent SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_done
StrCmp $LANGUAGE ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} 0 SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_en
MessageBox MB_ICONQUESTION|MB_YESNO|MB_DEFBUTTON2 "确定要彻底卸载 Snapmaker Orca V@Snapmaker_VERSION@ 及其全部组件吗？" IDYES SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_done
; "No" chosen: close the uninstaller immediately. Use Quit, not Abort --
; Abort inside a Section only aborts the section and leaves the wizard stuck
; on the progress (InstFiles) page instead of closing the window.
Quit
SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_en:
MessageBox MB_ICONQUESTION|MB_YESNO|MB_DEFBUTTON2 "Are you sure you want to completely uninstall Snapmaker Orca V@Snapmaker_VERSION@ and all of its components?" IDYES SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_done
Quit
SnapmakerOrcaUn_confirm_done:
